commit ffa35636e506d4935ea4e09816b6ded2a51b0b0e

C03: the dangling-alternative question names the tail of the sentence without quoting it (DIALOGUE1521)

DIALOGUE1519 measured that the mind's required question quoted the whole fragment («Sólo me llegó "o en la de siempre": ¿a qué te referís?») and the App's reply policy rejected it as echoing the person's text, publishing a composed guess instead. The instruction now asks to name the tail of the sentence without repeating the person's words («Sólo me llegó el final de la frase: ¿a qué te referís?») and the validator rejects a question that contains the whole fragment; verified offline against the same model (the first attempt quotes, the corrected retry does not).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


